# AB-031: Sweeping ammonia changes the composition of a basic buffer
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 NH4Cl 0.001mol
add v1 NH3 0.001mol
seal v1 100mL
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 NH4Cl 0.001mol
add v2 NH3 0.001mol
seal v2 100mL
measure v1 ph
measure v2 ph
sweep v2 1bar
wait 120s
measure v1 ph
measure v2 ph
inspect
